      <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748B;white-space:nowrap;">Notice date</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:14px;color:#1a1a2e;">1 October 2026</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748B;white-space:nowrap;">Fund</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:14px;color:#1a1a2e;">Administrative Fund</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748B;white-space:nowrap;">Amount payable</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:14px;color:#1a1a2e;"><strong>$$825.09</strong></td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748B;white-space:nowrap;">Due date</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:14px;color:#1a1a2e;"><strong>5 November 2026</strong></td></tr>
    </table>
    <h2 style="margin:16px 0 6px;font-size:15px;color:#1a1a2e;">How to pay</h2>
    <table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:0 0 8px;">
      <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748B;white-space:nowrap;">Account name</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:14px;color:#1a1a2e;">The Owners SP 12345</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748B;white-space:nowrap;">BSB</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:14px;color:#1a1a2e;">062-000</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748B;white-space:nowrap;">Account number</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:14px;color:#1a1a2e;">12345678</td></tr>
      <tr><td style="padding:4px 12px 4px 0;font-size:13px;color:#64748B;white-space:nowrap;">Reference</td><td style="padding:4px 0;font-size:14px;color:#1a1a2e;"><strong>LN-0042</strong></td></tr>
    </table>
    <p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:13px;color:#1A202C;line-height:1.6;">
      Interest: if this levy is not paid within one month after the due date, simple interest of 10% a year is charged from the due date until it is paid (Strata Schemes Management Act 2015 (NSW) s 85).
